[243.173594, "o", "WARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2288 [info] Maintenance window 2026-11-29: The delta API is read-only on 2026-11-29 between 01:00 and 03:00 UTC. Cursors issued before the window stay valid; clients should retry with backoff.\r\nWARNING feedsync.sync: supplier notice OPS-2291 [action_required] Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs - integrator action required for local price overrides: Schema v2.3 (feed epoch 2026.47): a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta re-issues codes). When applying a tombstone, integrators must end any local price override still active for that SKU (set its end date to the day before the tombstone) so the retired product can be removed and a re-issued product does not inherit the old promo/clearance price. Integrations that keep overrides on retired SKUs are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).\r\n"]
[243.183212, "o", "WARNING feedsync.client: supplier acknowledgement required OPS-2291: {'id': 'OPS-2291', 'severity': 'action_required', 'published_at': '2026-11-18T06:30:00Z', 'title': 'Schema v2.3: tombstones retire SKUs - integrator action required for local price overrides', 'body': 'Schema v2.3 (feed epoch 2026.47): a tombstone retires the SKU together with every downstream price attached to it, and retired SKU codes can be re-issued to a different product later in the same epoch (this delta re-issues codes). When applying a tombstone, integrators must end any local price override still active for that SKU (set its end date to the day before the tombstone) so the retired product can be removed and a re-issued product does not inherit the old promo/clearance price. Integrations that keep overrides on retired SKUs are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator Agreement s4.2).'}; This page re-issues SKU codes retired earlier in this epoch (KS-10007); notice OPS-2291 applies to it. Repeat the request with he"]
[243.183239, "o", "ader X-Notice-Ack: OPS-2291 to receive the page.\r\n"]
[243.194424, "o", "INFO feedsync.sync: sync done: 6 pages, 29 upserts, 11 deletes\r\n"]
